// image-plane rectangle (1.7 x 0.95)  → 4 CylinderGeometry tubes r=0.018, black
// inner band line near bottom         → 1 tube, black
// two crossing diagonals TL-BR/TR-BL  → 2 tubes, black
// 4 edges centre-dot → rect corners   → 4 tubes, black
// projection-centre dot               → SphereGeometry(0.10), black
// 6 red arrows y=-1.35 z=+0.4         → ShapeGeometry + MeshBasicMaterial 0xff0000
// translation axis (camera centres)   → dashed row of short tubes, slate blue
// optical axis of active camera       → dashed tubes along -Z, slate blue
// active camera glyph                 → same glyph group, blue 0x1054a8
// near / far scene points             → SphereGeometry(0.10) orange / blue
// projection rays point → centre      → THREE.Line (2 pts), tinted
// image plane quad (flow view)        → PlaneGeometry(1.7,0.95) white translucent
// projected image dots                → SphereGeometry(0.05)
