  Move the slider or press play to release a movable <b style="color:#1054a8">blue</b> camera along the strip.
</div>

<div style="border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:5px;padding-top:5px;font-weight:bold">Guided demo</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:4px">
  <button id="stepPrev">◀ Prev</button>
